Value TOTAL_MEMORY (\d+)
Value USED_MEMORY (\d+)
Value FREE_MEMORY (\d+)
Value AVAILABLE_MEMORY (\d+)
Value USED_PCT (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^System Memory:\s+${TOTAL_MEMORY}KB total,\s+${USED_MEMORY}KB used,\s+${FREE_MEMORY}KB free,\s+${AVAILABLE_MEMORY}KB available,\s+${USED_PCT}% used rate -> Record
